        <mxCell id="c89" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 13.4, for fiscal 2026, as Step 5 leaves it. The Wholesale bar is selected: the other bars fade and the card shows that segment&#x27;s discounts. Edit interactions has set the matrix to None, so it still shows every segment. Outlined: the selected bar and the card&#x27;s value.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="534" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
